ney, including Chi, The Spa and the infinity pool overlooking the capital. \"Above the Moment. Be You. reflects our belief that luxury today is no longer defined solely by place, but by how a place makes you feel,\" said Jean-Marc Poli, Area General Manager. \"Perched above one of the world's most dynamic capital cities, we create an environment where guests can experience both the energy of Beijing and moments of genuine personal renewal. Guided by Shangri-La's timeless Asian hospitality, we look forward to welcoming travelers from around the world with warmth, care and meaningful experiences that stay with them long after their journey ends.\" Bring the spirit of \"Above the Moment. Be You.\" to life, indulge in a distinctive perspective on luxury in the heart of Beijing. This festive season, elevate every stay and every gathering. Shangri-La Circle members enjoy exclusive rewards with 3X Points on stays and 2X Points on dining. Enroll or sign in to unlock your privileges and begin your celebration above the Beijing skyline at Shangri-La.com.", "content": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PAID PLANS", "keywords": ["tra", "asi", "spt", "cmp", "hrt"], "creator": ["cision pr newswire"], "language": "english", "country": ["pakistan", "qatar", "turkey", "india", "tajikistan", "philippines", "uzbekistan", "taiwan", "yemen", "vietnam", "romania", "china", "afghanistan", "laos", "united arab emirates", "azerbaijan", "bahrain", "saudi arabia", "singapore", "bhutan", "armenia", "bangladesh", "hong kong", "timor-leste", "turkmenistan", "syria", "macau", "brunei"], "category": ["tourism", "top", "lifestyle"], "datatype": "pressrelease", "pubDate": "2026-11-26 11:40:00", "pubDateTZ": "UTC", "fetched_at": "2026-11-26 11:55:35", "image_url": null, "video_url": null, "source_id": "en_prnasisa", "source_name": "Pr Newswire Apac", "source_priority": 4111305, "source_url": "https://en.prnasia.com", "source_icon": "https://i.newsdata.io/en_prnasisa.png", "sentiment": "positive", "sentiment_stats": 